# int-positron-config reads no environment variables: it is a snapshot of
# Positron settings, keybindings, the extension list and the Chanwe Obsidian
# theme. themes/install.sh and scripts/release.sh take arguments only.
# If a script ever reads one, list it here with a placeholder and a comment.

# Environment catalog (source audit: 2026-10-16).
# No runtime configuration is currently required.

# Configuration is a catalog, not automatic secret provisioning.
# Runtime .env loading follows this repository's README; build/CI/OS examples are reference-only.
